notes: W3 container timing: the shortest sample (19 / 600) is not the frame period. DXVKit Plus 0.9.0's native grid on it read 31.58 fps and seeked one frame off; Swift Glance FrameTiming and DXVKit Plus 0.10.0 agree on every frame start (docs/data/w3-crosstest-fixtures.jsonl). The script's output differs from the committed bytes only in the mvhd / mdhd / tkhd creation dates.
